RedSpark includes the Qwen3-1.7B model files from Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B.

The model files are distributed under the Apache License 2.0. The model
license and upstream attribution are retained in model/Qwen3-1.7B/LICENSE and
model/Qwen3-1.7B/README.md.

RedSpark's training, inference, and data-flywheel code is project-authored.
Qwen3 architecture support is provided by the Hugging Face Transformers
package (transformers>=4.51.0).

